<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Life of compassion, kind words and gestures,</l><l>God’s love revealed in His human ways,</l><l>Feasting with sinners, healing the lepers,</l><l>How deep His pity, mercy and grace!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Christ was uplifted, draws all men to Him:</l><l>The cross of Christ—O fathomless love!</l><l>By men afflicted, by God forsaken,</l><l>There He redeemed us by His shed blood.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>All of death’s forces could not subdue Him;</l><l>Seed of the Woman, Satan He trod,</l><l>Broke all our bondage, raised us up with Him,</l><l>Made us alive, brought us into God.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>This Man ascended—highest place given:</l><l>Lord, Christ, and Leader, Savior of all!</l><l>Beloved Master, King, and Redeemer,</l><l>Highest name “Jesus!” gladly we call!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>This our confession, Christ is our Savior,</l><l>Our God has raised Him on the third day,</l><l>His love transforms us for His good pleasure,</l><l>Builds us up into His dwelling place.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
